§ `Part I - Preliminary`

§§ `3. Terms used`

-- Occupancy facts needed to decide whether an arrangement is a
-- residential tenancy agreement (s.3) and whether this Act applies (s.5).
-- Cross-Act meanings (strata lease, residential park, approved provider)
-- are taken as facts; this encoding does not re-state those other Acts.

DECLARE `occupancy arrangement` HAS
    `any person for valuable consideration grants to any other person a right to occupy premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the right to occupy is for the purpose of residence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises constitute or are intended to constitute a place of residence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are a site at a caravan park` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are a site at a residential park` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person has a right to occupy the site` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement is an existing fixed term long-stay agreement made in writing to which the Residential Parks (Long-stay Tenants) Act 2006 does not apply` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement is a strata lease` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement is a sublease of a strata lease` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement was entered into, renewed, extended, assigned or otherwise transferred after the commencement of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the tenant is a party to an agreement for the sale and purchase of the premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the period of the tenancy is one month or longer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement arises under a mortgage in respect of the premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a group of adjacent premises is owned by a company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises comprising the group are let by the company to persons who jointly have a controlling interest in the company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the tenant is a boarder or lodger` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the stated purpose is to confer a right to occupy premises for a holiday` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement is for a fixed term of 3 months or longer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is proof that the holiday purpose is bona fide` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement is entered into as lessor by a prescribed person or agency acting on behalf of the Crown` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the agreement is a prescribed agreement or of a prescribed class` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are any part of a hotel or motel` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are student accommodation provided by an educational institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are student accommodation provided by an entity other than the educational institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the student accommodation is provided other than for the purpose of making a profit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the student accommodation is prescribed for the purposes of section 5(3)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are any part of a hospital or nursing home` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are used for the purposes of a club` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are used to provide residential care by an approved provider` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the premises are prescribed premises or of a prescribed class` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a regulation provides that this Act shall not apply` IS A BOOLEAN
